# New game from power-on: START to the naming screen, START + A to confirm Felix's name, "Transfer data from Golden Sun?" answered No (RIGHT, A),
# then the opening story and the Sol Sanctum scene by mashing A (about 960 presses; ~23000 frames) until Jenna can be walked about.
# Worked out with the harness. Afterwards: B closes any menu A opened, then the field with the second screen's Status (GS2-1/2).
wait 300
press START 4
wait 60
press START 4
wait 100
press START 4
wait 100
press A 4
wait 120
press RIGHT 4
wait 30
press A 4
wait 100
mash A 192 30
mash A 192 30
mash A 160 30
shot story
mash A 320 14
mash A 55 14
wait 100
shot field0
